# Modular chamber proof for theme G (0.26.0).
# SigilsVault mossy dungeon kit, instanced at native 1-metre scale over
# the polygon renderer, every piece drawn from the one resident trim
# atlas. A 4x4m room: a floor, four walls, a ceiling, and a pillar.
#
# model       x    y    z    yawDeg
MAUS_FLOOR      0    0    0    0
MAUS_CEIL       0    0    3    0
MAUS_WALL      -2   -2    0    0
MAUS_WALL       2    2    0    180
MAUS_WALL      -2   -2    0    90
MAUS_WALL       2   -2    0    90
MAUS_PILLAR    -1   -1    0    0
